$ graphify install --project --platform trae-cn
  references       ->  .trae-cn/skills/graphify/references
  skill installed  ->  .trae-cn/skills/graphify/SKILL.md
graphify section written to <FIXTURE_ROOT>/project/AGENTS.md

Trae-cn will now check the knowledge graph before answering
codebase questions and rebuild it after code changes.

Note: unlike Claude Code, there is no PreToolUse hook equivalent for
Trae-cn — the AGENTS.md rules are the always-on mechanism.

